  "title": {
   "en": "Innocent Wind"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "Innocent Breeze"
   },
   {
    "ko": "순진한 바람"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\u003cThe relationship between the man I'm about to marry and my friend feels suspicious.\u003e\n\nYuju has decided to marry her longtime lover.\nThe most glorious moment of her life is ahead,\nshe decides to introduce her boyfriend to her three close friends.\n\nHowever, after that meeting\nsuspicious circumstances begin to emerge between her boyfriend and her friend,\nYuju tries to resolve the suspicions\nbut the two of them just kept pointing fingers at each other\nand giving contradicting explanations...\n\nWhose words are true and who is at fault?\nIn the end, the truth is finally revealed, and the blame lies squarely on Yuju's shoulders.\n\nIn front of a shattered Yuju\na female protagonist in the TV shows is facing the same situation as Yuju.\nIn the screen, she becomes prettier, seek revenges, and meets better men,\nultimately escaping from her eternal wounds and starting a new life.\n\nIf Yuju is doing the same,\ncan Yuju also go back to her happy self?\nOr is it all just a innocent wish?"
  },
